# TelOS Supabase Configuration
# Create a free Supabase project at https://supabase.com
# Then create a table called 'life_os_sync' with columns:
#   id (text, primary key), data (jsonb), updated_at (timestamptz)
#
# To configure, either:
# 1. Set these values in js/config.js before building, OR
# 2. Use the System tab in the app to enter credentials (stored in localStorage)

